            "path": "Content (1)/Scroll View/Viewport/Content/q6",
            "type": " RectTransform CanvasRenderer TextMeshProUGUI ContentSizeFitter FAQDesc",
            "sprite": "",
            "text": "<color=#174F7D><b>Why can’t I withdraw funds using my withdrawal account?</b></color>\r\n<color=#174F7D>\rThe same withdrawal account can be bound to a maximum of <color=#C9785D><b>two</b></color> app accounts. Please do not share your withdrawal account with others.\r</color>\r\n",
